nses of such attendant may  \nbe allowed in the same manner and to  \nthe same extent that travel expenses  \nare allowed to such claimant or  \nbeneficiary.\nBy virtue of the authority vested in  \nm e by section 111 of title 38 of the United \nStates Code, I hereby prescribe the fol­\nlow ing regulations governing the allow­\nan ce of travel expenses of claimants and \nbeneficiaries of the Veterans’  Adminis­\ntration and their attendants:\nSection L The Administrator of Vet­\nerans’  Affairs may author","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_10811.txt","sha256":"dee0d477ebbc5683673d4a442f52825e0f6c6e37ed81085a4f32923c17bff4e1","source":{"line":917,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"6a012cb463ca0e1c6bb927e958afc9a4ccd0327449ccf0cf6e1eba0b8bc9e461"}}]}
